id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110:m0030","quote":"協"}],"identity_note":"步騭子，撫軍將軍。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110","quote":"十（一）年卒，子協嗣，統騭所領，加撫軍將軍。協卒，子璣嗣侯。協弟闡，繼業爲西陵督，加昭武將軍，封西亭侯，鳳皇元年，召爲繞帳督。闡累世在西陵，卒被征命，自以失職，又懼有讒禍，於是據城降晉，遣璣與弟璿詣洛陽爲任，晉以闡爲都督西陵諸軍事、衞將軍、儀同三司，加侍中，假節領交州牧，封宜都公。璣監江陵諸軍事、左將軍。加散騎常侍，領廬陵太守，改封江陵侯；璿給事中、宣威將軍，封都鄕侯。命車騎將軍羊祜、荊州刺吏楊肇往赴救闡。孫皓使陸抗西行，祜等遁退。抗陷城，斬闡等，歩氏泯滅，惟璿紹祀。","source_term":"子協嗣"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu052-bz-father-xie","interpretation_note":"本來源明記世代。後綴只供識別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"snv_2iq_jes"}},{"id":"snv_2iq_jes_AA","label":"步璣","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"璣","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110:m0026","c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110:m0094","c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110:m0141"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110:m0026","quote":"璣"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110:m0094","quote":"璣"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line110"